    <CheatEntry>
      <ID>27</ID>
      <Description>"Step 9"</Description>
      <VariableType>Auto Assembler Script</VariableType>
      <AssemblerScript>{ Game   : Tutorial-x86_64.exe
  Version: 
  Date   : 2026-10-30
  Author : Pacmanninja998
  Description : 

  &lt;Optional info&gt;
  cmp dword ptr [rbx+14],1 checks the 4-byte team ID.

  je skipDamage jumps if the current actor is blue/team 1.

  Blue actors bypass movss [rbx+08],xmm0, so their calculated damage is not written.

  Red actors do not jump, so they execute the original health write normally.

}

[ENABLE]

aobscanmodule(TUT8,Tutorial-x86_64.exe,F3 0F 11 43 08 0F 2F 05 ** ** ** ** 7A ** 75 ** 48 8B 4B 60) // should be unique
